{
  "description": "The creature is shown in right-facing side profile, low to the ground on four short limbs. It has a broad, flat, pale gray-blue head with a blunt snout, large round eyes, and a slightly upturned mouth, giving an axolotl-like appearance. Six pink, feathery external gills protrude from the sides of the head and upper neck, three per side. The entire dorsal surface from just behind the gills over the arched back and along the full length of the long, tapering tail is covered in overlapping, dark brown to tan, keratinous scales arranged in diagonal rows. The ventral and lateral skin of the head, neck, belly, and limbs is pale, smooth to wrinkled, and lighter in color, with a segmented, ridged belly visible between the fore and hind limbs. The four limbs are thick and stout, ending in clawed feet, and the animal casts a soft shadow on a plain off-white background.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "broad, flat and blunt-snouted, pale gray-blue with darker speckling on the crown and cheeks, large round eye with dark pupil and light blue-gray iris on the side of the head, small round nostril near the snout tip, and a closed mouth with a slight smile; located at the anterior end of the body in front of the gills"
    ,
      "where": "anterior end, facing right"
    },
    {
      "part": "gills",
      "looks_like": "six pink, fleshy stalks with dense, filamentous, feather-like branches along their length, three on each side of the head/neck, the lower ones longer and more forward-curving",
      "where": "protruding laterally from the sides of the head and neck, behind the jaw and in front of the scaled back"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "large, overlapping, rounded to pointed keratinous plates/scales in dark brown with lighter tan edges, arranged in neat diagonal rows like roof shingles, heavily textured",
      "where": "covering the entire dorsal surface from the base of the gills over the arched back and continuing dorsally along the full length of the tail to the left edge of the image"
    },
    {
      "part": "plates",
      "looks_like": "same as scales - thick, overlapping armor plates forming a continuous carapace over the back",
      "where": "dorsal back and tail"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four short, thick, columnar limbs with pale, wrinkled, slightly glossy skin, with visible skin folds at the joints, two forelimbs under the chest and two hindlimbs under the rear of the scaled body",
      "where": "ventral side, supporting the body; forelegs under the neck/chest, hindlegs under the posterior belly"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "broad, five-toed feet with short, dark, curved claws on each toe, pale and wrinkled like the legs, toes splayed on the ground",
      "where": "at the distal end of each of the four legs, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, thick at the base and tapering to a point, dorsally covered in the same overlapping brown scales, ventral edge showing a thin strip of pale skin, extending straight back",
      "where": "posterior end of the body, extending to the left beyond the frame"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "small, scattered dark gray speckles and mottling on the pale skin of the head, cheeks, and neck, and subtle wrinkling/segmentation on the pale belly",
      "where": "on the head and neck skin and along the ventral belly between the legs"
    }
  ],
  "attached_objects": [],
  "animals": [
    "axolotl",
    "pangolin"
  ],
  "separate_bodies": 1,
  "heads": 1,
  "walking_legs": 4,
  "wings": 0,
  "extra_limb_pieces": 0,
  "tails": 1
}
